companies with their governance (yes, including Anthropic).<p>I won&#x27;t pretend I have this all figured out, but I&#x27;ve probably spent more time than is healthy on the &quot;why do good companies go bad&quot; question. Ask me anything!","title":"I'm Eric Ries, author of \"The Lean Startup\" and new book \"Incorruptible\" \u2013 AMA","updated_at":"2026-07-18T03:39:59Z"}],"hitsPerPage":30,"nbHits":416,"nbPages":14,"page":0,"params":"query=AI+cost&tags=story&numericFilters=points%3E40&hitsPerPage=30&advancedSyntax=true&analyticsTags=backend","processingTimeMS":37,"processingTimingsMS":{"_request":{"roundTrip":17},"afterFetch":{"format":{"highlighting":3,"total":4}},"fetch":{"query":3,"scanning":32,"total":36},"total":37},"query":"AI cost","serverTimeMS":42}
